  {
   "settings": {
    "event": [
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Now we enter the realm of \\c[3]Ebony Forest\\c[0]!",
       "transl": "Das hier ist der Eingang zum \\c[3]Elfenbeinwald\\c[0]!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "WHISTLING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "As expected...\\. it's full of trees.",
       "transl": "Wie der Name schon sagt...\\. ist er voller Bäume."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "EYES_CLOSED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[nickt]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yet there are no evil wolves in this forest. It's just viruses as always.",
       "transl": "Aber keine Sorge, böse Wölfe gibt's hier nicht. Nur die üblichen Virusgegner."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "WHISTLING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "MOPING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Also no bugs. I'm sure Emilie would be glad to hear that.",
       "transl": "Hier gibt's auch keine Käfer. Emilie wäre sicher erleichtert, das zu hören."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "WINK"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Seriously, though.\\. Emilie and her fear of bugs...\\. I don't quite get it.",
       "transl": "Aber mal im Ernst.\\. Emilie und ihre Insektenphobie... Ich versteh' das nicht."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "WONDERING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "She made such a huge deal out of the Faj'ro Temple boss. That giant moth, right?",
       "transl": "Vor dem Boss im Faj'ro-Tempel hatte sie eine Heidenangst. Diese Riesenmotte, erinnerst du dich?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "SURPRISED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[nickt]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "But when I asked her about the midboss...\\. that antlion?\\. No problem there!",
       "transl": "Aber der Zwischenboss...\\. dieser Ameisenlöwe, der war kein Thema für sie!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "WHISTLING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...How?",
       "transl": "... Як?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ANNOYED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Yeah, apparently it's all good because it's \"slow\" and \"stuck in the sand\".",
       "transl": "Ja, offensichtlich ging das für sie, weil \"langsam\" und \"im Sand steckend\"."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "SKEPTICAL"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Personally, I thought the antlion was much higher on the scary scale.",
       "transl": "Ich dachte, dass sie vor dem eigentlich so richtig Schiss haben müsste."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "WONDERING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[nickt]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Right? Well, that's Emilie for you.",
       "transl": "Ach, was soll's, so ist sie eben."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "COMPLAINING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Let's continue!",
       "transl": "Lass uns weitergehen!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "TOWARDS"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Over there is a pretty interesting spot!",
       "transl": "Da drüben ist eine interessante Stelle, die ich dir zeigen will!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.schneider2",
       "expression": "TOWARDS"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "task": {
       "orig": "Talk to Lukas in \\c[3]Vermillion Wasteland - Ebony Forest\\c[0] to proceed with his tour.",
       "transl": "Sprich mit Lukas im \\c[3]Elfenbeinwald\\c[0], um mit der Führung fortzufahren."
      }
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "settings": {
    "npcStates": [
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "UP"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I call this here the \\c[3]field of the indecisive flowers\\c[0].",
          "transl": "Ich nenne das hier das \\c[3]Feld der unentschlossenen Blumen\\c[0]."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "UP"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...?",
          "transl": "...?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Indecisive because they can't decide on what height to grow.",
          "transl": "Unentschlossen deshalb, weil sie sich nicht entscheiden können, bis zu welcher Höhe sie wachsen wollen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "WHISTLING"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I mean just look at them. Some are stuck on ground level, others several meters high.",
          "transl": "Ich meine, schau sie dir doch mal an. Manche sind auf Bodenhöhe, andere sind mehrere Meter hoch."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "SKEPTICAL"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "ASTONISHED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...Why?",
          "transl": "... Чому?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "MOPING"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Look, I can't even explain a lake to you, so what do you expect now?",
          "transl": "Schau, ich kann dir nicht mal erklären, was ein See ist, aber das hier soll ich dir erklären können?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "EYES_CLOSED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SMILE"
         }
        },
        null,
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Anyway, those flowers are awfully convenient for an elaborate jumping path, don't you think?",
          "transl": "Jedenfalls riechen die Blumen hier schwer nach einem kniffligen Springparcours, meinst du nicht auch?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[nickt]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I mean this wouldn't be CrossWorlds without unlikely jumping paths literally everywhere.",
          "transl": "Ich meine, das wäre nicht CrossWorlds, wenn's kein Springparcours wäre."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "EYES_CLOSED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "The only thing I'm missing here is the treasure chest to collect.",
          "transl": "Das Einzige, was ich hier vermisse, ist die Schatztruhe zur Belohnung."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "WHISTLING"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "So I suppose we both can guess when those flowers will come into play.",
          "transl": "Jedenfalls können wir uns beide wohl denken, wann die Blumen ins Spiel kommen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "WINK"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "EXHAUSTED"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Enough of this forest. Let's go back to the lake. There is one more location I want to show you.",
          "transl": "Gut, dann lass uns zurück zum See gehen. Es gibt da noch eine Stelle, die ich dir zeigen will."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.schneider2",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...!",
          "transl": "...!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "PROUD"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        {
         "task": {
          "orig": "Head back to \\c[3]Vermillion Wasteland - Crimson Lake\\c[0] to proceed with Lukas' tour.",
          "transl": "Kehre zum \\c[3]Purpursee\\c[0] zurück, um mit Lukas' Führung fortzufahren."
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ]
